                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 14 in No. 225.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">List of passengers on the</hi> “<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Haytian Republic.</hi>”</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 14.]</seg></opener>
                <p>N. Tassy, J. Nicholas, F. Paul, F. Prado, P. Flambert, L. Nicholas, A. Jean
                    Baptiste, A. Charmant, Léon Eugèbe, D. Charles Pierre.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-10-21T16:00:00-04:49">October 21, 1888, at 4 o’clock in the
                            afternoon</date>.</dateline></closer>
